Our client is an international online gaming company focused on delivering engaging and innovative gaming experiences, leveraging modern technologies to provide high-quality products and services for a global audience.
Perfect for those who aim to:
Develop games using an existing engine, leveraging ready-made modules and creating new ones to optimize development;
Manage the full game development lifecycle, from initial requirements to deployment and post-release support;
Develop and optimize game UI, animations, and interactive features, ensuring smooth gameplay across desktop and mobile devices;
Optimize rendering performance, memory usage, loading times, and FPS, particularly for animation-heavy slot games and mobile devices;
Collaborate with engineers, QA, and stakeholders to deliver new features, resolve issues, and meet project deadlines;
Integrate AI agents into development workflows to optimize operational processes.
Experience you’ll need to bring:
5+ years of experience with PixiJS and TypeScript in iGaming game development (slots, instant/crash games), including strong knowledge of PixiJS v7/v8;
Advanced TypeScript skills, including strict typing, generics, and clean architecture;
Experience with React and @pixi/react (or similar React-to-Pixi integrations);
Strong understanding of slot mechanics, game rounds, betting, server responses, bonus features, and game state transitions;
Experience optimizing rendering performance for mobile browsers, including iOS Safari;
Animation experience with Spine, GSAP, or custom timing solutions;
Practical experience with AI agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, or similar), including project configuration, task management, output verification, and integration into development workflows.
It's a perfect match if you have those personal features:
Strong teamwork and collaboration skills;
A responsible and disciplined approach to work;
Commitment to continuous learning and self-development;
Adaptability to a dynamic, fast-changing environment;
Results-oriented mindset.
Apply, and let your growth journey begin.
